---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import "../../styles/global.css";
---

<Layout
  title="3-Week Project Sprint | Knit it Now"
  description="A guided 3-week sprint for machine knitters: clear next steps, written and video guidance, and support to finish your project."
>
  <section class="guided-workshops-hero-wrap" aria-label="Introduction">
    <div class="guided-workshops-hero-inner">
      <div class="guided-workshops-hero-grid">
        <div class="guided-workshops-hero-figure">
          <img
            class="guided-workshops-hero-img"
            src="/images/help.svg"
            alt="Help and support illustration"
            width="120"
            height="211"
            loading="eager"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>
        <header class="guided-workshops-hero">
          <div class="guided-workshops-hero-eyebrow">3-Week Guided Sprint</div>
          <h1>From "Idea" to "Finished Garment" in 3 Weeks</h1>
          <p class="guided-workshops-lead">
            You bring the vision. I’ll build the roadmap to get that dream project off your mood board and onto your knitting machine
          <br><b>A 3-week guided sprint</b> where you get a clear plan, support as you knit, and help finishing a real project on your machine.
            No guessing. No overwhelm. Just steady progress.</p>
            <div class="guided-workshops-hero-cta">
            <a 
              href="mailto:sue@knititnow.com?subject=3-Week%20Sprint%20Inquiry&body=Hi%20Sue,%0A%0AI’m%20interested%20in%20the%203-week%20sprint.%0A%0AHere’s%20what%20I’m%20working%20on:%0A%0AWhat’s%20not%20working:%0A%0AWhat%20I’d%20love%20help%20with:%0A"
              class="kbm-btn kbm-btn-primary">
              
              <span class="button-content">
                <i class="fas fa-envelope"></i>
                Let’s Talk About Your Project
              </span>
              
            </a>
          </div>
        </header>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container pt-4 pb-5">
    <div class="guided-workshops-inner">
      <section class="guided-workshops-block" aria-labelledby="gw-for-heading">
        <h2 id="gw-for-heading">Who This Is For</h2>
        <p>This sprint is a good fit if:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><b>The Dream Project:</b> You have a specific design in mind but need the technical roadmap to translate it to your machine.</li>

<li><b>The "Special" Yarn:</b> You have luxury yarn in your stash that you’re afraid to ruin without a solid plan.</li>
<li> <b>Skip the Math:</b> You want to bypass the "figuring it out" phase so you can just get to the knitting.</li>
<li><b>Total Confidence:</b> You want a proven 3-week process so you can cast on without second-guessing your settings.</li>
<li><b>Any Machine:</b> Whether your setup is manual or electronic, I’ll help you make it work for your specific design.</li>         </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="guided-workshops-block" aria-labelledby="gw-get-heading">
        <h2 id="gw-get-heading">What You Get</h2>
        <p>During your sprint, you can expect:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><b>A Custom Roadmap</b> (Your step-by-step guide from cast-on to bind-off)</li>
          <li><b>Personal Video Troubleshooting:</b> (I'll record custom clips to show you exactly how to handle techniques and technical challenges)</li>
          <li><b>Experienced Skills Review:</b> (I'll help you master the specific techniques your dream project requires before you start).</li>
          <li><b>On-Demand Video Help:</b> No Zoom calls required. Send a photo or a quick video of your machine or swatch whenever you have a question. I’ll respond with a custom video walkthrough so you can keep moving at your own pace.</li>          
              </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="guided-workshops-block guided-workshops-steps" aria-labelledby="gw-how-heading">
        <h2 id="gw-how-heading">How It Works</h2>
        <div class="guided-workshops-steps-panel">
          <div class="guided-workshops-step">
            <span class="guided-workshops-step-num" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
            <div class="guided-workshops-step-body">
              <h3>Week 1 — The Vision & Roadmap</h3>
              <p>You share your project, and I build your plan.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="guided-workshops-step">
            <span class="guided-workshops-step-num" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
            <div class="guided-workshops-step-body">
              <h3>Week 2 — Swatch & Technique</h3>
              <p>We dial in your settings and approach.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="guided-workshops-step">
            <span class="guided-workshops-step-num" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
            <div class="guided-workshops-step-body">
              <h3>Week 3 — Cast-On & Progress</h3>
              <p>You start knitting with confidence and support.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="guided-workshops-closing" aria-label="Next step">
        <p>
          Stop dreaming about "someday" and start knitting with a plan. Let’s build your roadmap and get that project on the needles.        </p>
        <br>Sprints are scheduled based on your timeline and my availability. We’ll pick a start date that works for you during our first chat.
       
        <div class="guided-workshops-closing-cta">
        <a 
          href="mailto:sue@knititnow.com?subject=3-Week%20Sprint%20Inquiry&body=Hi%20Sue,%0A%0AI’m%20interested%20in%20the%203-week%20sprint.%0A%0AHere’s%20what%20I’m%20working%20on:%0A%0AWhat’s%20not%20working:%0A%0AWhat%20I’d%20love%20help%20with:%0A"
          class="kbm-btn kbm-btn-primary">
          
          <span class="button-content">
            <i class="fas fa-envelope"></i>
            Let’s Talk About Your Project
          </span>
          
        </a>
      </div>
       
       
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .guided-workshops-inner {
      max-width: 960px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .guided-workshops-hero-wrap {
      width: 100%;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      padding-top: 2.3rem;
      padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .guided-workshops-hero-inner {
      max-width: min(1200px, 100%);
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
      padding-left: max(1rem, env(safe-area-inset-left));
      padding-right: max(1rem, env(safe-area-inset-right));
    }

    .guided-workshops-hero-grid {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 1.2rem;
    }

    .guided-workshops-hero-figure {
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      justify-content: flex-start;
    }

    @media (min-width: 769px) {
      .guided-workshops-hero-figure {
        margin-left: 0.4rem;
      }
    }

    .guided-workshops-hero-img {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: min(150px, 100%);
      height: auto;
    }

    .guided-workshops-hero {
      flex: 1 1 0;
      min-width: 0;
      max-width: 34rem;
      text-align: left;
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .guided-workshops-hero-grid {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: stretch;
        gap: 1.5rem;
      }

      .guided-workshops-hero-figure {
        justify-content: center;
        display: none;
      }

      .guided-workshops-hero {
        max-width: none;
      }

      .guided-workshops-hero-wrap {
        padding-top: 1.65rem;
        padding-bottom: 1.8rem;
      }
    }

    .guided-workshops-hero h1 {
      font-size: var(--text-xxl);
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--kbm-green);
      margin: 0 0 0.95rem 0;
    }

    .guided-workshops-hero-eyebrow {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: rgba(36, 48, 21, 0.7);
      margin: 0 0 0.45rem 0;
      line-height: 1.2;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    .guided-workshops-lead {
      color: #243015;
      line-height: 1.65;
      margin: 0;
      max-width: none;
      font-size: var(--text-lg);
    }

    .guided-workshops-hero-cta {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-top: 1.35rem;
    }

    .guided-workshops-block {
      margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
    }

    .guided-workshops-block h2 {
      font-size: var(--text-xl);
      color: var(--kbm-green);
      margin: 0 0 0.65rem 0;
    }

    .guided-workshops-block p {
      margin: 0 0 0.85rem 0;
      color: #243015;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .guided-workshops-block ul {
      margin: 0;
      padding-left: 1.2rem;
      color: #243015;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .guided-workshops-block li {
      margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    }

    /* Tighter transition: “What You Get” → “How It Works” only */
    .guided-workshops-block[aria-labelledby="gw-get-heading"] {
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .guided-workshops-steps {
      margin-bottom: 2.75rem;
    }

    .guided-workshops-steps > h2 {
      max-width: min(40rem, 100%);
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
      margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
    }

    .guided-workshops-steps-panel {
      max-width: min(40rem, 100%);
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
      padding: 1.25rem 1.35rem 1.1rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--ring, #e5e8e0);
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: rgba(82, 104, 45, 0.06);
    }

    .guided-workshops-steps .guided-workshops-step {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 1.3rem;
      padding: 1.5rem 0;
    }

    .guided-workshops-steps .guided-workshops-step:first-child {
      padding-top: 0.35rem;
    }

    .guided-workshops-steps .guided-workshops-step:last-child {
      padding-bottom: 0.35rem;
    }

    .guided-workshops-steps .guided-workshops-step + .guided-workshops-step {
      padding-top: 1.65rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--ring, #e5e8e0);
    }

    .guided-workshops-step-num {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      width: 2rem;
      height: 2rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: var(--text-sm, 0.875rem);
      font-weight: 600;
      line-height: 1;
      color: #fff;
      background: var(--kbm-green);
      margin-top: 0.28rem;
    }

    .guided-workshops-step-body {
      min-width: 0;
      flex: 1 1 auto;
    }

    .guided-workshops-steps h3 {
      font-size: var(--text-lg);
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--kbm-green);
      margin: 0 0 0.35rem 0;
      line-height: 1.35;
    }

    .guided-workshops-steps .guided-workshops-step-body p {
      margin: 0;
      color: #243015;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .guided-workshops-closing {
      margin-top: 0.5rem;
      padding-top: 1.5rem;
      padding-bottom: 2rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--ring, #e5e8e0);
    }

    .guided-workshops-closing p {
      margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
      color: #243015;
      line-height: 1.6;
      max-width: 44rem;
    }

    .guided-workshops-closing-cta {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 1.1rem;
    }
  </style>
</Layout>
